# Upstream grub fix series (post-2.14, grub master, by Nicholas Vinson) for
# the i386-pc kernel.img link under modern binutils.  grub 2.14's i386-pc
# kernel.img links via -Wl,--image-base, and binutils >= 2.39 (-z separate-code)
# maps the ELF headers into the first PT_LOAD, shifting .text off the required
# 0x9000 base ("grub-mkimage: kernel.img is miscompiled: start address 0x9074").
# These commits switch i386-pc to a custom linker script + --defsym=_grub_text_base.
# Reverting the --image-base AX_CHECK_LINK_FLAG block also removes grub's
# autoconf-archive build dependency.  Drops when ONIE moves to grub >= the
# release that includes these (post-2.14).
0001-build-i386-pc-update-kernel-image-generation.patch
0002-revert-configure-print-helpful-error-if-autoconf-archive-missing.patch
0003-revert-configure-check-linker-for-image-base-support.patch
0004-configure-drop-ttext-checks-for-i386-pc.patch
